# Analysis artifacts, deliberately not versioned on a public repository:
#  - SuuntoLink binaries and decompilation: proprietary Suunto software
#  - Microsoft redistributable DLLs
#  - pcap captures: they carry the watch serial number and personal POIs (home)
assets/
full-assets/

# Field reports pasted straight from a `write_nav.py settings` run: they quote BLE
# link keys and a phone MAC verbatim. Their findings belong in HANDOFF.md, with the
# values redacted; the raw notes stay local.
HANDOFF-append-*.md
